# Elefante v2.14.0 release authorization

Authorized: 2026-09-01
Purpose: Publish the strict-project local memory control loop, verified
Remember/Correct/Recover operations, complete package lifecycle, and curated
Elefante Home maintenance console prepared in PR #30.
Source changes: PR #30

Publication requirements:
- Every maintained version declaration and the dated changelog entry resolve
  to 2.14.0.
- PR #30 quality, dashboard, dependency audit, clean macOS lifecycle, and all
  platform package gates are green at the exact head before merge.
- The published customer surface contains 18 tools and 2 prompts, including
  verified Recover; Task Intelligence remains default-off and carries no
  representative multi-task outcome-lift claim.
- The exact final package satisfies the approved product-release gate in
  `workspace/proposals/four-action-product-lifecycle.md` Section 11, or the
  owner records an equally strict explicit manual approval. This marker may be
  reviewed on the PR branch, but it must not be merged while that gate remains
  unresolved.
- Release assets carry release provenance and pass independent SHA-256
  verification after publication.
- Website version synchronization follows accepted core publication and must
  pass maintained production and rendered-state verification.
- Published historical tags remain immutable.
